{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-37620","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41010","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-37621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41011","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-41012","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-41013","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-41014","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41015","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-41016","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41017","text":" markdown file across all 20 projects becomes a page whose route *is* its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-41018","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-41019","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-37622","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41020","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-37623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41021","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-41022","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-41023","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-41024","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-41025","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-41026","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-41027","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-37624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41028","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-41029","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-41030","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-41031","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41032","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-37625","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41033","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-37626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41034","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41035","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-41036","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-41037","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-37627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41038","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-41039","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-41040","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41041","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41042","text":" scans the repo (excluding "},{"id":"spn-41043","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-41044","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41045","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-41046","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41047","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-41048","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41049","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-41050","text":", etc.), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-41051","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41052","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-41053","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41054","text":" "},{"id":"spn-41055","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-41056","text":" file plus top-level READMEs. 223 docs / 20 projects. 2. "},{"id":"spn-41057","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-41058","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41059","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41060","text":" parses the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-41061","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41062","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-41063","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-41064","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes. 3. "},{"id":"spn-41065","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-41066","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-41067","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-41068","text":" links that resolve to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build). 4. "},{"id":"spn-41069","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-41070","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-41071","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-41072","text":" is checked to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-37628","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41073","text":"The campus *is* Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-41074","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-41075","text":" idea; the pages *are* BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-37629","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41076","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-37630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41077","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-41078","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-41079","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-37631","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41080","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-37632","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-37633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41081","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-37634","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 223 real docs mirrored from 20 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 9 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-37635","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41082","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-37636","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41083","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-41084","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-41085","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-41086","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-41087","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-41088","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-37637","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41089","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-37640","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41090","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-41091","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-41092","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41093","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-41094","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-37641","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41095","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-41096","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-41097","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-37644","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-41098","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-37645","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41099","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41100","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-37646","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37649","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41101","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41102","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-37648","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41103","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41104","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-37650","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37653","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41105","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41106","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-37652","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41107","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-41108","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41109","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-41110","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-37654","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41111","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-41112","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-41113","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-41114","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41115","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-41116","text":", "},{"id":"spn-41117","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-41118","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-37656","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-41119","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41120","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41121","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41122","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-41123","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-41124","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-37658","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraa45gwpjzor7gvybeti2evpx7c5776mgia6cp4ql242v6h55rjm4q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}